NAME
     yes – be repetitively affirmative

SYNOPSIS
     yes [expletive ...]

DESCRIPTION
     The yes utility outputs expletive, or, by default, “y”, forever.  If
     multiple arguments are given, they are concatenated into a single space-
     separated string.

SEE ALSO
     jot(1), seq(1)

HISTORY
     The yes command appeared in Version 7 AT&T UNIX.

